sdata> -- PE-7 (design.md sec6.3, ADR-061, -q variant): interactive-mode statements must be
sdata> -- echoed to screen even under piped/non-tty stdin, where the terminal's own
sdata> -- canonical-mode echo does not apply. This is the audit's own repro
sdata> -- (part-e-io-operators-implementation-notes.md), pinned as a direct
sdata> -- regression guard.
sdata> USE MOCK
sdata> LET Z = 5
sdata> PRINT Z
sdata> RUN
sdata> QUIT
